### Variabel
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard

### Daftar paket
GET {{base}}/api/plans

### Tambah paket
POST {{base}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Home 30 Mbps", "speed": "30M/30M", "monthlyPrice": 250000, "mikrotikProfile": "paket-30m" }

### Daftar router
GET {{base}}/api/routers

### Cek router sekarang
POST {{base}}/api/routers/1/check

### Cari pelanggan
GET {{base}}/api/customers?q=budi

### Daftarkan pelanggan baru (otomatis buat user PPPoE)
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rina Marlina",
  "phone": "6281200000004",
  "address": "Jl. Sudirman 4",
  "pppoeUsername": "rina",
  "pppoePassword": "rina12345",
  "planId": 1,
  "routerId": 1,
  "dueDay": 10
}

### Ganti paket
PUT {{base}}/api/customers/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planId": 2 }

### Terbitkan tagihan bulan ini
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/generate

### Lihat tagihan bulan ini
GET {{base}}/api/invoices

### Bayar tagihan
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "QRIS" }

### Jalankan isolir otomatis sekarang
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/isolate-overdue

### Isolir manual
POST {{base}}/api/customers/2/isolate

### Buka tiket gangguan
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "subject": "Internet mati", "description": "Lampu LOS merah", "category": "NO_INTERNET" }

### Tugaskan teknisi
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technician": "Rudi" }

### Selesaikan tiket
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/1/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Ganti patchcord di ODP" }

### Antrian tiket terbuka
GET {{base}}/api/tickets
